# {/dat} {/Hij} de ver-ge{\ving} {/der} {/&/zon}{den_} **
# mo-ge schen-ken aan {\on}{\ze} {/&/&/&\&\&\&/zie~&~&~&~&~&~&_}{\len_}. [:]

